  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "With the launchpad of the main menu providing a nice amount of info like recent updates to avatar faves, world faves etc. it'd be nice if we could have a quick way to open the main menu directly to the MM launchpad. I'm aware of the expand button in the top right corner but I'm talking about bypassing the QM, straight to MM whenever needed.\nFor example, at least for the buttons on the touchpads on index controllers, right now they go unused, and in the previous menu's bindings it was mentioned those would be reserved for a future update. What about letting those be mapped finally as well as an option in the bindings menu to map opening the main menu directly to a controller binding?",
